  "prompt": "What was each segment's MRR on 31 December 2025, in euros? MRR comes from subscription_events: a subscription's MRR on a date is the sum of its mrr_delta_local with event_date on or before that date, in its subscriptions.currency. Every event counts, opening events included. Convert at that day's rate: multiply by fx_rates.eur_per_unit for the subscription's currency on 2025-12-31. Round to 2 decimals with ROUND. Return two columns, in this order: segment and mrr_eur. Return one row for each segment. Any row order is fine.",
